Note: If you are copying the assert statement in csharp code, it's good practice to add the `[Conditional("DEBUG")]` attribute to avoid the assert statements when your application is in release mode. 
For instance:

```cs
[Conditional("DEBUG")]
Debug.Assert(New_arrListIndexOfX <= Old_index);
```

